Decision after review (2026-11-21, main agent, not the maintainer): keep os.Root semantics — a symlink or junction that is absolute or leads outside the root is refused, also for plugin sources linked into Plugins/ from a shared checkout (they are outside the root by definition; set files.root to a directory holding both, or put the plugin into the project). Wrap Go's 'path escapes from parent' with a message that names the cause (a link on the path is absolute or leads outside the root) and the root; document it in the skill and README.

